WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- [Questioner] Should I launch
my business on the side,

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.666
(Gary clears throat) (crowd murmurs)

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:02.499
- [Man On Right] Thanks, man.

00:00:02.499 --> 00:00:04.241
or take a gap year and try to launch it?

00:00:04.241 --> 00:00:05.074
- Both work.

00:00:05.074 --> 00:00:05.907
- Both?

00:00:05.907 --> 00:00:07.500
- Both work.
- Which one is the best?

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.324
- I don't know you well enough, you know.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:11.157
You know what I mean?

00:00:11.157 --> 00:00:11.990
They both work.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.623
- Yes.
- Which one do you wanna do?

00:00:13.623 --> 00:00:15.753
- [Questioner] I would like
to try to take a gap year--

00:00:15.753 --> 00:00:17.190
- So take a gap year.
- but I'm scared.

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.630
- Well that's why you're asking.

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.560
- [Questioner] Yes,
which one would you do?

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.810
- I wouldn't take either.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:25.190
- [Questioner] What would you do then?

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:26.710
- I can't answer that for you.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.460
Fear is holding you back,
you know what you wanna do.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.740
The only reason you're not doing it is,

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:33.743
you're scared of doing what
you actually wanna do, right?

00:00:33.743 --> 00:00:35.250
- Goodness, that's right--
- Are you scared to do it

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.540
'cause your parents won't like it?

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.450
- [Questioner] No, my
parents actually support me.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.630
- Okay, so what are
you scared of, failing?

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:45.870
- Not failing, but still
being at the same place,

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:48.870
when my friends are at the next level.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.410
- Huge mistake, you don't want

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.180
the same thing your friends want.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.300
So why the fuck do you
care what they have?

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.810
Number one mistake so many people make

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:58.130
is they care about what other people have.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.850
I don't give a fuck what anybody has.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:01.650
If I have more, if I have
less, it doesn't matter,

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.490
I worry about myself.

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:04.323
The fact that you're worrying

00:01:04.323 --> 00:01:05.560
about other peoples' accomplishments,

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.130
is already a losing formula.

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:08.180
You need to get rid of that first,

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:09.580
then you can focus on yourself.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:10.472
- [Questioner] Thank you.
- You understand?

00:01:10.472 --> 00:01:13.639
(inspirational music)

